1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,300
Fifty thousand rupees, credited. By the twentieth… where did it go?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,900
Let's follow one salary.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,100
Rent, fifteen thousand. EMI, five. Bills, three. You saw those coming.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,100
Food, travel, one OTT plan. Fourteen thousand more. Life happens.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,300
A five-thousand rupee SIP. Future you says thanks.

6
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,900
And then… eight thousand rupees. Sixteen percent of your salary. No name. No category.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,300
It's never one big thing. A chai. A late-night order. A renewal you forgot. A UPI tap.

8
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,900
Type it like a message — 'swiggy 320' — and every rupee gets a name.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,900
Try the free demo. Link in bio.
